# The Haxe program of the plugin test: it uses the plugin the build
# macro found in plugins/ beside the output. Rebuild with
# `haxe plugin.hxml` (Haxe 4.3.6) from this directory, with the math
# plugin's library in plugins/; plugin.hl is checked in.
-cp src
-lib caribou
-main UsePlugin
-hl plugin.hl
